Changes in this version (2026, Alexander de Toro Todorov, developed with the help
of Claude Code): support for VS Code for the Web (vscode.dev, github.dev),
including a platform abstraction layer, in-browser Python execution with Pyodide,
C++/Haskell execution through the Compiler Explorer API, file access through
vscode.workspace.fs, new icons and branding, and small bug fixes.
Modified files carry a notice at the top.

